ption></figure><figure><img alt=\"南韓性感女神的亞洲百大DJ「DJ SODA」，在全球享有高知名度！（Instagram / @deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230814/767749962670804992025967.jpeg/6Dm3I14TCE4kFxPmirZS-ZfVb2NdnFolep5_8nqef_I\"/><figcaption>南韓性感女神的亞洲百大DJ「DJ SODA」，在全球享有高知名度！（Instagram / @deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><p>AI女團成員竟宣布懷孕！還沒出道就請產假掀熱議　網友傻眼：孩子爸是誰⋯？</p><p>昔日偶像轉行當OL！前AKB48成員宣布新身分 自曝「從零學電腦」</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T04:25:11.997383+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1734,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:00:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:00:43.851106+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:51.376690+00:00","content_hash":"1ffc82a3ff050c57af3184041cd7c1f03bbff16d9f0e976ff08b9c70cd249440","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}